PROVENANCE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The routing pattern documented here — a local Gemma 4 E2B worker behind a
supervisor agent, the four-field worker contract (finding / evidence_pointer /
confidence / next_action), and the local_inspection_worker subagent definition —
originates in a public post by the copyright holder:

    "Stop Burning Tokens on Tasks Gemma 4 E2B Can Handle"
    u/SuperDaveWho, r/google_antigravity
    https://www.reddit.com/r/google_antigravity/comments/1tvwdmh/

README.md in this directory is written from that post.

